    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gray Haven, A yuri action RPG where you become a girl who has lost her memories and explores the nightmares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share love with the girls in the village or enhance your equipment to prepare for the next adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With outstanding impact and smooth controls, the action plays out exactly as you imagine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nightmares to help the girls recover their memories and find their true selves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will devote their hearts and bodies entirely to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 300 sweet and diverse lines recorded by professional voice actors! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares are spaces filled with grotesquely twisted monsters and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcase every action you imagine with perfect, smooth controls that respond instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters using a wide range of weapons, from guns and gauntlets to greatswords and katanas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/3026b1d966c25a630a1ed11b5c96d84b.avif?t=1750402263\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your village into a space that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack towers of corpses and skeletons or create a garden with flowerpots and fences\u2014it\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Gray Haven</strong>&quot; is a world designed just for you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/5a233b14f26718b1efdb2114318a7dba.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gray Haven, A yuri action RPG where you become a girl who has lost her memories and explores the nightmares.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share love with the girls in the village or enhance your equipment to prepare for the next adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With outstanding impact and smooth controls, the action plays out exactly as you imagine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/a4178e71f9d3b71a56ffbde03f3da01b.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nightmares to help the girls recover their memories and find their true selves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will devote their hearts and bodies entirely to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy over 300 sweet and diverse lines recorded by professional voice actors! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.poster.avif?t=1750402263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.webm?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/21fbf1cbdb92327840e0bc90d1371540.mp4?t=1750402263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares are spaces filled with grotesquely twisted monsters and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Showcase every action you imagine with perfect, smooth controls that respond instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters using a wide range of weapons, from guns and gauntlets to greatswords and katanas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2314650/extras/3026b1d966c25a630a1ed11b5c96d84b.avif?t=1750402263\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your village into a space that reflects your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack towers of corpses and skeletons or create a garden with flowerpots and fences\u2014it\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Gray Haven</strong>&quot; is a world designed just for you.</p>",
